# Two-player Graffiti (run graffiti2p; here 16 s): a grind line ground in a combo is tagged for its
# player when the combo banks. Player 1 grinds the ledge (park grind line 11): tagged, 475. Player 2
# grinds it later and manuals on into a bigger combo (BS 50-50 + Manual, 1336): it steals the tag.
# Player 1 grinds it again with the smaller 475: no steal. At the end player 2 owns 1, player 1 none.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
cmd 0 player2 join 0 -0.6 0.14 90
cmd 0 setData run.twoPlayer.graffiti.seconds 16
cmd 0 run graffiti2p
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
bot balance
p2 hold up 606..700
p2 hold ollie 690..705
p2 tap grind 776
p2 tap up 1052
p2 tap down 1057
p2 hold ollie 1170..1180
p2 bot balance
cmd 1300 teleport 0 -0.6 0.14 90
hold up 1306..1400
hold ollie 1390..1405
tap grind 1476
run 2000
expect event graffitiStart{seconds=16} within 1..1
expect event tagged{player=1,obstacle=line:11,points=475,from=0} within 467..467
expect session.owned == 1 at 500
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + Manual,points=1336,player=2} within 1282..1282
expect event tagged{player=2,obstacle=line:11,points=1336,from=1} within 1282..1282
expect session.owned == 0 at 1300
expect session2.owned == 1 at 1300
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50,points=475,player=1} within 1767..1767
expect event tagged count == 2
expect event graffitiOver{winner=2} within 1920..1920
expect session2.owned == 1 at end
expect session.mode == over at end
expect no event bail
